            <title>Klippa 1.0.13</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in 1.0.13</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Press Space on an image card for a Quick Look style preview</li>
                    <li>New image editor (E): red pen, circles, crop and rotation with undo</li>
                    <li>Hold (⌘P) keeps a preview on screen while you work in other apps</li>
                    <li>Edited images are saved back to the card at full resolution</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
